factcheck by groq/qwen/qwen3.8-27b: 3 problems
  reel_script states 'മഞ്ചേരിയിൽ സ്ത്രീകളെ അപമാനിച്ച കേസിൽ' (In the case of insulting women in Manjeri), which is factually incorrect. The article states the case is about insulting a specific woman from Manjeri ('മഞ്ചേരി സ്വദേശിയുടെ'), not women in general in Manjeri. The headline and caption correctly say 'മഞ്ചേരി സ്വദേശിയെ' (a person from Manjeri), but the reel_script incorrectly generalizes it to 'സ്ത്രീകളെ' (women) and adds the location 'മഞ്ചേരിയിൽ' which implies the act happened in Manjeri or targets women there, whereas the article says the victim is from Manjeri and the act was on a YouTube channel.
  slides_spec slide 1 line 2 says 'മഞ്ചേരി സ്വദേശിയെ അറസ്റ്റിലാക്കി' (Arrested a person from Manjeri). This is factually incorrect. The arrested person is from Kannur Azhikkod (കണ്ണൂർ അഴീക്കോട് സ്വദേശി). The person from Manjeri is the victim.
  caption English summary says 'Manjeri man arrested'. This is factually incorrect. The arrested man is from Kannur Azhikkod. The man from Manjeri is the victim.
